text = "Hey, don't just sit there bro, it's What's Shakin' Bacon's Worldwide Day of Play bro! An ENTIRE day devoted to getting active bro! And to celebrate Worldwide Day of Play bro, you, yes YOU won't be able to play this game for the remainder of the day bro. The rest of the guys are out to play bro, which is where YOU should be bro. Tell your family bro, get your friends bro, grab your dog bro, and do ANYTHING that gets you up and active bro! Once you've played, there will be more fun to have here tomorrow bro! But up until then bro, YOU'RE STUCK WITH ME BRO."